        "content": "9. INTERNAL LINKING STRATEGY\nOutbound: → Country pages (where respiratory therapy is recognised & in demand) · →\nAcademic Yatra (IELTS/OET) · → ApplyVisa Yatra (visa/PR/family) · → other course pages ·\n→ About/Contact · → Free Resources (respiratory-care guide). Inbound: Home \"Courses\"\nmenu → Respiratory Therapy; MBBS page \"Other Healthcare Careers\" → here; blog\n(\"respiratory therapist salary USA/Canada\", \"NBRC guide\", \"where is respiratory therapy\nrecognised\") → here. Anchor text: descriptive (\"study respiratory therapy abroad\", \"critical\ncare technology course\", \"respiratory therapist in Canada\"), not \"click here.\"\n\n\nBuilt on the course-page template. Study-abroad focused. Keep all compliance callouts\n(illustrative salaries, country-by-country recognition honesty, no guarantees) intact. End of\n\nRespiratory Therapy & Critical Care master content."
