        "content": "9. INTERNAL LINKING STRATEGY\nOutbound: → Country pages (where dietetics is well-regulated & in demand) · → Academic\nYatra (IELTS/OET) · → ApplyVisa Yatra (visa/PR/family) · → other course pages (esp.\nPhysiotherapy & Rehab — sports nutrition overlap, Public Health page) · → About/Contact ·\n→ Free Resources (nutrition guide). Inbound: Home \"Courses\" menu → Nutrition; MBBS\npage \"Other Healthcare Careers\" → here; blog (\"RDN guide USA\", \"HCPC dietitian UK\",\n\"sports nutrition careers\") → here. Anchor text: descriptive (\"study dietetics abroad\",\n\"sports nutrition course abroad\", \"RDN USA\"), not \"click here.\"\n\n\nBuilt on the course-page template. Study-abroad focused. Keep all compliance callouts\n(illustrative salaries — fresh set, Dietitian vs Nutritionist title honesty, no guarantees) intact.\nEnd of Nutrition & Dietetics master content."
