        "title": "9. INTERNAL LINKING STRATEGY",
        "content": "9. INTERNAL LINKING STRATEGY\nOutbound: → Country pages (where P&O is well-regulated & in demand) · → Academic\nYatra (IELTS/OET) · → ApplyVisa Yatra (visa/PR/family) · → other course pages (esp.\nPhysiotherapy & Rehab, MBBS) · → About/Contact · → Free Resources. Inbound: Home\n\"Courses\" menu → P&O; MBBS page \"Other Healthcare Careers\" → here; Physiotherapy &\nRehab page → here; blog (\"how to become a prosthetist\", \"MSPO USA guide\", \"HCPC\nprosthetist UK\") → here. Anchor text: descriptive (\"study prosthetics orthotics abroad\",\n\"MSPO USA\", \"rehab engineering master's\"), not \"click here.\"\n\n\nBuilt on the course-page template. Study-abroad focused. Keep all compliance callouts\n(illustrative salaries — fresh set, accreditation honesty, no guarantees) intact. End of\nProsthetics & Orthotics master content."
